docs_zh/

# Experiment predictions (~500 MB) and feature/model caches (~6 GB): see experiments/README.md
experiments/predictions/
experiments/.cache/
experiments/logs/

docs/*_zh.md
experiments/**/*.npy
experiments/**/*.done
